    "detailed_description": "<i>Super Grapple Day</i> is an Adult Visual Novel about college women wrestling and also having sex. It features a branching story with meaningful choices, turn-based combat, and hundreds of exciting animations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Grapple Day!</h2><br>You\u2019ve been keeping a secret from your girlfriend. Every year, your fraternity hosts a private event that raises tens of thousands of dollars for charity: a no-holds-barred submission wrestling tournament featuring some of the hottest girls on campus. When your girlfriend finds out about Grapple Day, she\u2019s offended. . . that you didn\u2019t invite her to join too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186950/extras/a7e8447e0b612e2f4a8dbf4e3d0bfce6.poster.avif?t=1731004834\" width=766 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186950/extras/a7e8447e0b612e2f4a8dbf4e3d0bfce6.webm?t=1731004834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186950/extras/a7e8447e0b612e2f4a8dbf4e3d0bfce6.mp4?t=1731004834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive wrestling fights<br></li><li>Nearly 5,000 images, including hundreds of unique 2D animations<br></li><li>About 6 hours of gameplay (plus additional story routes and an Endless mode)<br></li><li>A story of rivalries, romance, humor\u2026 and revenge!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Allowed During the Grapple Day Tournament</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dirty tactics<br></li><li>Gloating<br></li><li>Humiliation<br></li><li>Stripping<br></li><li>Flirting<br></li><li>Sex</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Not Allowed</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Being a real jerk (you can only play one in the wrestling ring)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fight Never Ends</h2>This definitive version of the game collects all of the previously released episodes and adds a ton of new content. In addition to the main story, the game also includes an all-new Endless Mode where you face off against randomly generated opponents. Level up your fighter and collect perks to try to set a new high score!",
